*** Variables ***
@{COMPONENTS}              Navigation    Power    Engines    Life Support    Communications
@{FIRMWARE_VERSIONS}       v2.1.0    v2.2.0    v2.3.0
${MIN_COMPATIBILITY_SCORE}    85

*** Keywords ***
Check Component Compatibility
    [Arguments]    ${component}    ${firmware}    ${compatibility_score}
    Log    Testing ${component} with firmware ${firmware}
    Should Be True    ${compatibility_score} >= ${MIN_COMPATIBILITY_SCORE}    msg=Compatibility too low: ${compatibility_score}
    Log    ${component} compatible with ${firmware} (score: ${compatibility_score})

